<title>UK: Ford unit sets $1.0 bln 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Ford unit sets $1.0 bln 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD MOTOR CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    $1.0 BLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    15.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  L-11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  45 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+60 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		   L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX/SI/HK PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/SGP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR UST</p>
<p> NOTES	GLOBAL DOLLAR BOND</p>
<p>		SPREAD IS IN 60 BASIS POINTS AREA</p>
<p> NOTES	MORGAN STANLEY IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
